# Every file here is committed and listed in SHA256SUMS: override the repository-wide
# ignore patterns for compiled files (*.so, *.dll, ...).
!*
!*/
# ...except the caches the portable Python writes when it runs (never committed).
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# ...but never Envelock keys, identities or passwords (also refused by scripts/check_release.py).
*.enc.json
owner*.json
recipient*.json
installation*.json
identity*.bin
generated_keys.h
audit_keys.h
*password*.txt
